annotations and Theodosius’ Syriac commentary on the &lt;i&gt;Book of Hierotheos&lt;/i&gt;. A final appraisal of the relationship between Origenism and the transmission of philosophy from Greek into Arabic is provided.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
